# Or-patterns in pattern tests

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration SchoolStatus:
  -- Before
  -- During
  -- After

declaration structure Child:
  data status content SchoolStatus
  data age content integer

declaration enumeration Payment:
  -- ByCheck content money
  -- ByTransfer content money
  -- InKind

#[test]
declaration scope S:
  internal children content list of Child
  internal payments content list of Payment
  output before_or_during content list of boolean
  output combined content list of boolean
  output large_payment content list of boolean
  output with_binding content list of boolean
```

```catala
scope S:
  definition children equals [
    Child { -- status: Before -- age: 5 };
    Child { -- status: During -- age: 10 };
    Child { -- status: After -- age: 17 };
    Child { -- status: After -- age: 15 }
  ]
  definition payments equals
    [ByCheck content $500; ByTransfer content $2,000; InKind]

  definition before_or_during equals
    map each child among children to
      child.status with pattern (Before or During)

  definition combined equals
    map each child among children to
      child.status with pattern (Before or During) or child.age >= 16

  definition large_payment equals
    map each payment among payments to
      payment with pattern (ByCheck content amount or ByTransfer content amount)
      and amount > $1,000

  definition with_binding equals
    map each payment among payments to
      payment with pattern (ByCheck content amount or ByTransfer content amount)
```

```catala-test-cli
